WEBVTT

00:00:02.871 --> 00:00:06.875
Man:
I have strength enough for this.

00:00:25.060 --> 00:00:27.938
Harry Potter...

00:00:28.146 --> 00:00:30.482
We meet again.

00:00:30.691 --> 00:00:32.109
Voldemort.

00:00:32.317 --> 00:00:36.280
Yes. You see what I've become?

00:00:36.488 --> 00:00:40.117
See what I must do to survive?

00:00:40.325 --> 00:00:44.454
Live off another. A mere parasite.

00:00:45.122 --> 00:00:48.458
Unicorn blood can sustain me...

00:00:48.667 --> 00:00:52.337
But it cannot give me
a body of my own.

00:00:52.504 --> 00:00:56.091
But there is something that can.

00:00:56.300 --> 00:01:01.972
Something that, conveniently enough,
lies in your pocket.

00:01:02.347 --> 00:01:03.849
Stop him!

00:01:08.937 --> 00:01:11.690
Voldemort: Don't be a fool.

00:01:12.190 --> 00:01:15.319
Why suffer an horrific death...

00:01:15.527 --> 00:01:19.156
When you can join me and live?

00:01:19.364 --> 00:01:20.449
Never!

00:01:22.451 --> 00:01:27.247
Bravery. Your parents had it too.

00:01:27.998 --> 00:01:31.293
Tell me, Harry...

00:01:31.543 --> 00:01:35.380
Would you like to see
your mother and father again?

00:01:35.672 --> 00:01:37.758
Together...

00:01:37.966 --> 00:01:40.510
We can bring them back.

00:01:40.886 --> 00:01:45.641
All I ask is for something in return.

00:01:52.356 --> 00:01:55.484
That's it, Harry.

00:01:56.360 --> 00:02:00.238
There is no good and evil.

00:02:00.405 --> 00:02:03.408
There is only power...

00:02:03.659 --> 00:02:07.788
And those too weak to seek it.

00:02:08.413 --> 00:02:13.502
Together, we'll do
extraordinary things.

00:02:13.919 --> 00:02:16.171
Just give me the stone!

00:02:18.799 --> 00:02:19.925
You liar!

00:02:45.826 --> 00:02:51.123
- What is this magic?
- Fool, get the stone!

